  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into MarginMetric</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents margin-based quantities used as metrics.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents numeric metrics based on prediction margins.</rdfs:comment>
