<owl:Class rdf:about="#LabeledSet">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#LabeledSet"/>
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#Dataset"/>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into LabeledDataset</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: ‘Historical’ is a temporal/provenance attribute better captured via metadata or properties, not as a dedicated subclass.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Redundant naming for the same concept as InitialLabeledSet; prefer a single canonical subclass and deprecate this variant.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents previously collected labeled data.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into LabeledData</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Overly specific/redundant variant of InitialLabeledSet; does not justify a separate class and should be folded into the canonical initial-labeled concept.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents the labeled portion of a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents a set of labeled samples used in training or evaluation.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents datasets where examples have associated labels.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents a subset of labeled samples from a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents an explicitly labeled dataset.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents labeled datasets from the source domain.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents a small seed set of labeled examples.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents the initial labeled pool or seed dataset.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents the initial labeled set used to seed active learning.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LabeledSubset</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LabeledSampleSet</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LabeledSet</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LabeledDataset</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">HistoricalLabeledData</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LabeledSourceDataset</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">InitialLabeledPool</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">InitialLabeledSeedSet</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">InitialLabeledSet</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LabeledData</rdfs:label>
  <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="#QueryByCommittee">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#QueryByCommittee"/>
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#QueryStrategy"/>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents strategies that measure and exploit disagreement between committee members.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents classic committee-based active learning methods.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into ModelDrivenQueryStrategy</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents query strategies based on uncertainty criteria.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents query strategies based on sample informativeness.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into DisagreementBasedQueryStrategy</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents the disagreement signal used in committee-based methods.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into QueryByCommittee</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: “Informativeness” is a loose, ambiguous term that largely subsumes or overlaps uncertainty- and information-based strategies; not a clearly distinct or canonical category, and partially redundant with other subclasses.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents query strategies driven primarily by model-centric signals.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents query strategies based on information-theoretic measures.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents strategy formulations of query-by-committee.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Overlaps heavily with model-driven strategies (most model-based criteria use predictions) and is too vague to be a clean, widely recognized category; offers little additional value over other, more specific subclasses.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents active learning methods using committees of models for disagreement.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents query strategies that rely on model predictions.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents query strategies based on optimal experimental design principles.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Represents the disagreement signal itself, not a query strategy; type-mismatched as a subclass of a strategy class and better modeled separately if needed.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents query strategies relying on committee or model disagreement.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into CommitteeDisagreementStrategy</rdfs:comment>
  <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">InformationBasedQueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DisagreementBasedQueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PredictionBasedQueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CommitteeDisagreementStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">QueryByCommitteeStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">OptimalDesignQueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CommitteeBasedActiveLearning</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">InformativenessBasedQueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ModelDrivenQueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UncertaintyBasedQueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CommitteeDisagreement</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">QueryByCommittee</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="#QueryStrategy">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#QueryStrategy"/>
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#ActiveLearning"/>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ActiveLearningQueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LeastConfidenceSampling</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UncertaintyBasedStrategies</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AcquisitionObjective</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">LeastConfidenceStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">RandomAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BatchAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UncertaintySampling</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MarginSamplingStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DiversityBasedAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">RegionBasedAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AcquisitionFunctionMethod</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">QueryStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PureUncertaintySampling</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ImageBasedAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UncertaintyBasedAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">HybridUncertaintyDiversityAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AcquisitionFunction</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ActiveLearningAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">InformationGainBasedAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into ActiveLearningQueryStrategy</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies that rely on uncertainty estimates.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents uncertainty sampling without additional diversity or structure constraints.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies that focus on selecting spatial regions.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents classic uncertainty sampling strategies in active learning.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into UncertaintySampling</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents specific methodological implementations of acquisition functions.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies that select instances randomly as a baseline.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into UncertaintyBasedAcquisitionStrategy</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies that combine uncertainty and diversity signals.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies specifically designed for active learning.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents families of uncertainty-based selection strategies.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies that emphasize diversity among selected instances.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents query strategies used to choose which instances to label.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents mathematical acquisition functions that score candidate instances.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into LeastConfidenceSampling</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies that select batches of instances per iteration.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents uncertainty sampling based on the margin between top class probabilities.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents strategies selecting instances with lowest prediction confidence.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents algorithmic rules for selecting query candidates.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into AcquisitionFunction</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies driven by expected information gain.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents optimization objectives underlying acquisition strategies.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Redundant, unused plural/generic variant of the parent class UncertaintyBasedAcquisitionStrategy; keeping only the concrete, standard method class UncertaintySampling.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents uncertainty sampling based on least confident predictions.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents acquisition strategies that operate at image or patch level.</rdfs:comment>
  <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="#BreastCancerHistopathologyClassificationTask">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#MedicalImageClassificationTask"/>
  <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents breast cancer classification tasks on histopathology images.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Overly specific leaf task class with zero usage; adequately covered by the existing parent MedicalImageClassificationTask and can be modeled via properties (modality, disease) instead of dedicated classes.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Too specific to a particular disease-modality combination (breast cancer on histopathology). This level of granularity is better captured via properties (e.g., target disease, organ, imaging modality) on instances of MedicalImageClassificationTask rather than dedicated subclasses.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BreastCancerHistopathologyClassificationTask</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

