  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents generative adversarial active learning methods.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents specific algorithmic implementations of GAAL.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into GenerativeAdversarialActiveLearning</rdfs:comment>
