  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: This class is highly specific to region-based clustering on point clouds, combining both a particular data modality (point clouds) and a specific clustering strategy. It is unused and overly narrow for the general ClusteringBasedActiveLearning category. Prefer to remove or, if needed in the future, reintroduce under a more appropriate, modality-specific branch.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">RegionBasedPointCloudActiveLearning</rdfs:label>
  <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="#ClusteringForDiversityMethod">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#ActiveLearning"/>
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#ClusteringForDiversityMethod"/>
  <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ClusteringForDiversityMethod</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ClusteringBasedActiveLearning</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Merged into ClusteringBasedActiveLearning</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents methods that use clustering specifically to promote diversity.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Clustering-based methods can be viewed as concrete realizations of density/representativeness-based strategies. To avoid a proliferation of implementation-specific subclasses, this is deprecated in favor of the more general DensityBasedActiveLearning (and Diversity-based) categories.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents active learning methods that rely on clustering.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Largely overlaps with and is a subset of DensityBasedActiveLearning; keeping both adds redundancy with little added value.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

