  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: DensePixelLevelAnnotationConstraint is a very specific subtype of MedicalAnnotationConstraints (constraints requiring dense pixel-level annotations) rather than a general synonym. Given the guidance to keep the ontology flat and its lack of usage, it should be removed rather than kept as a distinct subclass.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DensePixelLevelAnnotationConstraint</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="#MedicalAnnotationConstraints">
