  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Specific NLP task with no current usage (num_cqs=0). Not essential for current deep active learning queries, so it is deprecated to keep the ontology compact.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents part-of-speech tagging tasks.</rdfs:comment>
