  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Niche and method-specific (Bayesian data augmentation for AL) with no usage. Considered too narrow for a separate class under generative active learning; can be described textually or via method properties instead.</rdfs:comment>
  <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
</owl:Class>

