  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Represents a particular combination of two more specific domain classes; too narrow and compositional, better represented via properties or relations.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents combined machine and human translation datasets.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

