  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Very specific subtype (3D vs 2D) of MedicalImageSegmentationTask with zero usage (num_cqs=0). The dimensionality distinction can be modeled via properties or annotations when needed, rather than a dedicated class, to keep the task hierarchy compact.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Represents 3D medical image segmentation tasks such as CT or MRI volume segmentation.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">3DMedicalImageSegmentation</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

