  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Deprecated: Unused (no CQs/answers) and semantically vague compared to the clearer, more useful ActiveLearningTaxonomy; removing it reduces redundancy without losing essential distinctions.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Conceptual representation of iterations in active learning processes.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ActiveLearningIterationConcept</rdfs:label>
